  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Divide both the numerator and denominator by the common factor \\(2xy\\): \\(4x^2y/(2xy)=2x\\) and \\(6xy^2/(2xy)=3y\\). Therefore, \\(k=3\\).",
